    <p>Welcome to <strong>LifeWebLab</strong>, your global digital laboratory dedicated to practical troubleshooting, digital payments, and web tech solutions.</p>
    
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>In a fast-paced digital ecosystem, errors in payment gateways, API configurations, and web services can halt business operations. Our mission is to research, document, and share step-by-step solutions that empower professionals and businesses worldwide to solve technical problems swiftly and effectively.</p>
    
